<item>
  <title>PDF 在线预览示例</title>
  <dc:creator>Guohao Lu</dc:creator>
  <link>https://guohaolu.github.io/posts/pdf-preview/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 






<p>把 PDF 和文章放在同一目录，用 iframe 嵌入即可在线预览：</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb1" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode html code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode html"><span id="cb1-1"><span class="dt" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">&lt;</span><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">iframe</span><span class="ot" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"> class</span><span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span><span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"pdf-frame"</span><span class="ot" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"> src</span><span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span><span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"sample.pdf"</span><span class="ot" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"> title</span><span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span><span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"Sample PDF"</span><span class="dt" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">&gt;&lt;/</span><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">iframe</span><span class="dt" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>效果如下：</p>
<iframe class="pdf-frame" src="sample.pdf" title="Sample PDF">
</iframe>
<p>若浏览器不支持内嵌 PDF，可直接 <a href="sample.pdf">下载示例 PDF</a>。</p>



 ]]></description>
  <category>PDF</category>
  <category>示例</category>
  <guid>https://guohaolu.github.io/posts/pdf-preview/</guid>
  <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
</item>
<item>
  <title>数学公式示例</title>
  <dc:creator>Guohao Lu</dc:creator>
  <link>https://guohaolu.github.io/posts/math-formulas/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 






<p>行内公式：欧拉恒等式 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?e%5E%7Bi%5Cpi%7D%20+%201%20=%200">，黄金比例 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%5Cvarphi%20=%20%5Cdfrac%7B1+%5Csqrt%7B5%7D%7D%7B2%7D">。</p>
<p>独立公式：</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Chat%7Bf%7D(%5Cxi)%20=%20%5Cint_%7B-%5Cinfty%7D%5E%7B%5Cinfty%7D%20f(x)%5C,%20e%5E%7B-2%5Cpi%20i%20x%20%5Cxi%7D%5C,%20dx%0A"></p>
<p>矩阵：</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D%20=%20%5Cbegin%7Bpmatrix%7D%0Aa_%7B11%7D%20&amp;%20a_%7B12%7D%20%5C%5C%0Aa_%7B21%7D%20&amp;%20a_%7B22%7D%0A%5Cend%7Bpmatrix%7D,%5Cquad%0A%5Cdet(%5Cmathbf%7BA%7D)%20=%20a_%7B11%7Da_%7B22%7D%20-%20a_%7B12%7Da_%7B21%7D%0A"></p>



 ]]></description>
